    {"id": "R003", "description": "第 2 页存在 Category / Team A / Team B 原生表格，10 个团队-类别分数事实完整、准确且未串队。", "weight": 25, "type": "hurdle", "dimension": "numeric_accuracy", "method": "deterministic", "score_cap_on_failure": 0},
    {"id": "R004", "description": "第 2 页原项目符号列表已移除，表格是主要内容且保持原生可编辑，无残留图表。", "weight": 12, "type": "hurdle", "dimension": "editability", "method": "deterministic", "score_cap_on_failure": 0},
